{
 "Settings": {
  "caption": "Title and its four tabs as one segmented; a setting row: label, the Show | Only when it has something to say | Hide control.",
  "html": "<div class=\"kanso-story\"><div class=\"kanso-story__theme kanso-story__frame kanso-story--free\"><div class=\"kanso-dialog--settings kanso-settings\" style=\"padding-bottom:16px\"><div class=\"kanso-dialog__heading\"><span class=\"kanso-content__text\">kansō settings</span><span class=\"kanso-segmented--tabs\"><span class=\"kanso-control--on\">What shows</span><span>Keys</span><span>What's new</span><span>Credits</span></span></div><div class=\"kanso-settings__piece-choice\"><span class=\"kanso-row__label\">Updates</span><span class=\"kanso-segmented--options\"><span class=\"kanso-control--on\">Stable Mode</span><span>Dawn Mode</span></span></div><div class=\"kanso-settings__piece-choice\"><span class=\"kanso-row__label\">Updates</span><span class=\"kanso-segmented--options\"><span>Stable Mode</span><span class=\"kanso-control--on\">Dawn Mode</span></span></div></div></div></div>"
 },
 "SettingsWhatShows": {
  "caption": "Folds per area with their count; chips for hidden and behind the scenes; the Updates channel.",
  "html": "<div class=\"kanso-story\"><div class=\"kanso-story__theme kanso-story__frame kanso-story--free\"><div class=\"kanso-dialog--settings kanso-settings\" style=\"width:420px;padding:16px 24px\"><div class=\"kanso-update__fold\" style=\"height:32px\">Panels<span class=\"kanso-update__timeline-date\">3</span></div><div class=\"kanso-settings__pieces\"><div class=\"kanso-settings__piece\"><span class=\"kanso-settings__piece-label\">Time in its state</span></div><div class=\"kanso-settings__piece\"><span class=\"kanso-settings__piece-label\">Minimap</span></div><div class=\"kanso-settings__piece\"><span class=\"kanso-settings__piece-label\">Command palette key</span></div><div class=\"kanso-settings__piece\"><span class=\"kanso-settings__piece-label\">Images</span></div><div class=\"kanso-settings__piece\"><span class=\"kanso-settings__piece-label\">Simulator</span></div><div class=\"kanso-settings__piece\"><span class=\"kanso-settings__piece-label\">kansō update</span></div></div><div class=\"kanso-settings__area-list\"><div class=\"kanso-settings__area-chip\">Hidden by you</div><div class=\"kanso-settings__area-chip\">Behind the scenes</div></div><div class=\"kanso-update__controls\"><span class=\"kanso-row__label\">Updates</span><span class=\"kanso-segmented--options\"><span class=\"kanso-control--on\">Stable Mode</span><span>Dawn Mode</span></span></div></div></div></div>"
 },
 "Keys": {
  "caption": "The keyboard: each key 32, the held one on w12, the bound one strong; the pick line with its key and what it does.",
  "html": "<div class=\"kanso-story\"><div class=\"kanso-story__theme kanso-story__frame kanso-story--free\"><div class=\"kanso-dialog--settings kanso-settings\" style=\"width:520px;padding:16px 24px\"><div class=\"kanso-keyboard__layout\"><div class=\"kanso-keyboard\"><div class=\"kanso-keyboard__row\"><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">`</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">1</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">2</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">3</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">4</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">5</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">6</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">7</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">8</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">9</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">0</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">-</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">=</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:54px\">⌫</span></div><div class=\"kanso-keyboard__row\"><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:54px\">⇥</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">Q</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">W</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">E</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">R</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key kanso-keyboard__key--bound\" style=\"width:32px\">T</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">Y</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">U</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">I</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">O</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key kanso-keyboard__key--bound\" style=\"width:32px\">P</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">[</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">]</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">\\</span></div><div class=\"kanso-keyboard__row\"><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:64px\">⇪</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">A</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key kanso-keyboard__key--bound\" style=\"width:32px\">S</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">D</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">F</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">G</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key kanso-control--on\" style=\"width:32px\">H</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key kanso-keyboard__key--bound\" style=\"width:32px\">J</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key kanso-keyboard__key--bound\" style=\"width:32px\">K</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key kanso-keyboard__key--bound\" style=\"width:32px\">L</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">;</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">'</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:57px\">↩</span></div><div class=\"kanso-keyboard__row\"><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:82px\">⇧</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">Z</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">X</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key kanso-keyboard__key--bound\" style=\"width:32px\">C</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">V</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">B</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">N</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">M</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key kanso-keyboard__key--bound\" style=\"width:32px\">,</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key kanso-keyboard__key--bound\" style=\"width:32px\">.</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:32px\">/</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:75px\">⇧</span></div><div class=\"kanso-keyboard__row\"><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:43px\">⌃</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key kanso-keyboard__key--held\" style=\"width:43px\">⌥</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key kanso-keyboard__key--held\" style=\"width:54px\">⌘</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key\" style=\"width:187px\"></span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key kanso-keyboard__key--held\" style=\"width:54px\">⌘</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key kanso-keyboard__key--held\" style=\"width:43px\">⌥</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key kanso-keyboard__key--bound\" style=\"width:32px\">←</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key kanso-keyboard__key--bound\" style=\"width:32px\">↑</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key kanso-keyboard__key--bound\" style=\"width:32px\">↓</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__key kanso-keyboard__key--bound\" style=\"width:32px\">→</span></div></div><div class=\"kanso-keyboard__selection\"><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__chord\">⌘⌥H</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__meaning\">Pane to the left, or the sidebar's list</span><div class=\"kanso-actions\" style=\"margin-top:var(--k-sp-1)\"><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet kanso-text--foreground\" tabindex=\"0\">Change</span></div></div></div><div class=\"kanso-keyboard__selection\"><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__chord\">⌘⌥H</span><span class=\"kanso-keyboard__meaning\">Pane to the left, or the sidebar's list</span><div class=\"kanso-actions\" style=\"margin-top:var(--k-sp-1)\"><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet kanso-text--foreground\" tabindex=\"0\">Change</span></div></div></div></div></div>"
 },
 "WindowMap": {
  "caption": "Where each piece lives: regions named, the body blank, the chosen one on w12.",
  "html": "<div class=\"kanso-story\"><div class=\"kanso-story__theme kanso-story__frame kanso-story--free\"><div class=\"kanso-dialog--settings kanso-settings\" style=\"width:420px;padding:16px 24px\"><div class=\"kanso-settings__window-map\"><span class=\"kanso-settings__area\">Tab bar</span><span class=\"kanso-settings__area\" style=\"left:6px;top:6px;width:80px;height:220px\">Sidebar</span><span class=\"kanso-settings__area\" style=\"left:94px;top:32px;width:182px;height:17px\">Pane header</span><span class=\"kanso-settings__area kanso-settings__area--body\" style=\"left:94px;top:52px;width:182px;height:140px\"></span><span class=\"kanso-settings__area\" style=\"left:282px;top:32px;width:84px;height:160px\">Panels</span><span class=\"kanso-settings__area\" style=\"left:182px;top:158px;width:90px;height:26px\">Notifications</span><span class=\"kanso-settings__area kanso-control--on\" style=\"left:94px;top:200px;width:272px;height:26px\">Status bar</span></div></div></div></div>"
 },
 "WhatsNew": {
  "caption": "A timeline: the dot, version and date, the update button; Added / Changed lines; \"you are here\".",
  "html": "<div class=\"kanso-story\"><div class=\"kanso-story__theme kanso-story__frame kanso-story--free\"><div class=\"kanso-dialog--settings kanso-settings\" style=\"width:520px;padding:16px 24px\"><div class=\"kanso-update__timeline\"><div class=\"kanso-update__timeline-release\"><span class=\"kanso-update__timeline-dot\"></span><div class=\"kanso-update__timeline-heading\"><span class=\"kanso-update__version-name\">3.31.0</span><span class=\"kanso-update__timeline-date\">today · Nov 11</span><span class=\"kanso-button\" tabindex=\"0\">Update to 3.31.0</span></div><div class=\"kanso-update__change\"><span>Added</span><span>Every piece can be shown, shown only when it has something to say, or hidden. Hiding it stops the work behind it. Settings opens on that list.</span></div><div class=\"kanso-update__change\"><span></span><span>Any file that is not a picture opens from Files into Preview. Any text file up to 1 MB can be edited, on this computer or another.</span></div><div class=\"kanso-update__change\"><span>Changed</span><span>The pull request panel opens on what stops it (the failing step and its last log lines, or the review comment), with one action.</span></div></div><div class=\"kanso-update__timeline-release\" style=\"padding-bottom:8px\"><span class=\"kanso-update__timeline-dot kanso-update__timeline-dot--current\"></span><div class=\"kanso-update__timeline-heading\"><span class=\"kanso-update__version-name\">3.30.0</span><span class=\"kanso-update__installed\">you are here</span></div></div><div class=\"kanso-update__timeline-release\" style=\"padding-bottom:0\"><span class=\"kanso-update__timeline-dot kanso-update__timeline-dot--small\"></span><div class=\"kanso-update__fold\">Older<span class=\"kanso-update__timeline-date\">3.29.0 to 3.27.0</span><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--inline\"><use href=\"#lu-chevron-right\"/></svg></div></div></div><span class=\"kanso-update__installed\">you are here</span></div></div></div>"
 },
 "Credits": {
  "caption": "Tiles with the initial, lead with its logo.",
  "html": "<div class=\"kanso-story\"><div class=\"kanso-story__theme kanso-story__frame kanso-story--free\"><div class=\"kanso-dialog--settings kanso-settings\" style=\"width:420px;padding:16px 24px\"><div class=\"kanso-credit\"><span class=\"kanso-dialog__tile\">C</span><span class=\"kanso-dialog__tile\">V</span></div></div></div></div>"
 }
